  "schema": "bee.docs-corpus@1",
  "selection_rule": "Runtime reference: only the Lua base and type system, channel, contract, process, registry, time, JSON, HTTP client, security, UUID, filesystem, SQL and TTY pages used by Bee app authors; the SQL reference includes sql.builder. Runtime tutorials, internals, general guides and platform material are excluded. Bee contracts: the docs/ pages that state an implemented callable boundary or the path a frozen artifact travels (application, threads, placement, gateway, carrier, storage, ui, harness, approvals, registry, platform), excluding repository process and design pages. Component: one README per Bee package under src/ or modules/. Terminal toolkit: one generated page composed from modules/application/src, src/apps and compact examples; visualization examples are extracted from tests/lua/frame. The corpus is digest-checked with the rest.",
